multisig_program (5BeQ7VMZHYdnUD6PyrMd29WQo2DLfo7N2NDXCDQZ5MQc)
15 instructions; accounts: 3 fixed, 3 keyed, 54 caller-chosen; 1 hotspot (0 allowed)

Hotspots
  A fixed account has one address for every caller, so every instruction that
  writes it takes the same write lock.

  program_config
    address  GyAudv6F9kQirHntXGVdYdBDMr2fbrdrgakYyN74gbV8
    seeds    "multisig-program-config"
    writers  config_initialize, config_update
    readers  multisig_create, multisig_import
    Every `config_initialize` and `config_update` in the cluster runs one at a time; the 2 instructions that read it wait for each one.

